    LLM: 'Build toward two sambas or canastas; meet initial meld; avoid holding red threes if you cannot go out.\n\nEvery samba contains 8, 9 or 10; if opponents hold canastas in those ranks in your suit, switch to canastas. Meld 8-9-10 sequences early so partner can add.\n\nUse wilds to block discard pile when it holds cards opponents need. Red threes only pay when you have the two required sets to go out.',
